THESE INSTRUCTIONS ARE PRIMARILY INTENDED FOR LINUX PLATFORMS AND UTILIZE GNU GFORTRAN

To compile the source code open the folder in console and type: make
To clean the folder after compilation type: make clean
    NOTE! This will also delete the created simulation program file!

If the make script does not work you can also compile manually by typing: 
gfortran -O3 -o simulation constants.f90 vectors.f90 simulation.f90